/v1/","context":{"app_id":4402300,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4402300-1842212951299071","game_id":"steam-4402300","kind":"announcement","title":"🐴 Derby Life is Joining gamescom 2026!","summary":"Are you joining us? 🫵Hi Riders 🏇,We're pleased to inform you that Derby Life: Ranch & Race will be joining the upcoming Gamescom 2026 digitally! 🎮🐴What's Derby Life: Ranch & Race?😌Derby Life: Ranch & Race is where great racehorses are made, not born. Breed, raise, and train your own on a living open-world ranch, then saddle up and race the World Tour. Roam, fish, explore, compete. Your ranch, your horse, your glory! 🏇 Our Journey ContinuesBeing part of gamescom is another exciting milestone on t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T06:45:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951299071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402300-1840944183772725","game_id":"steam-4402300","kind":"announcement","title":"DERBY LIFE : RACNH & RACE IS ON SOCIAL MEDIA!! 🔥","summary":"FOLLOW THE JOURNEY!Greetings, Riders! We're pleased to announce that we're officially on social media handles! 🥳All the latest updates on our development, in-game & Discord events, release dates, demos, and more will be posted on our social media handles. That said, we welcome all Riders around the world to join our official Discord server, then follow our other social media handles (links posted below), and join our journey!Handles as follows ⤵️SOCIAL HANDLESLinksDiscordhttps://discord.gg/YXRgE","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T01:02:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183772725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402300-1830163047258886","game_id":"steam-4402300","kind":"announcement","title":"New Energy in the Paddock: 'Path Riding Training'","summary":"Hello, aspiring Ranchers! We’re back with our fourth Dev Log!Last time, we explored the 'Condition' system that governs the variables of the race. Today, we’re stepping out of the stalls and into the wide Paddock to introduce a new way to bond with your horse: 'Path Riding Training'! Our team wanted the Paddock in to be more than just a place for rest. We envisioned it as a space where Ranchers can breathe with their horses and hone their riding skills.'Path Riding Training' is an active trainin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T01:05:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402300-1828894815559651","game_id":"steam-4402300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Variable of Victory — 'Condition' System","summary":"While we originally planned to discuss the 'Paddock' today, we’ve adjusted the order to prioritize the 'Condition' system. To truly master the management depth of our game, understanding how to maintain your horse's peak form is essential.No matter how elite the lineage or how intense the training, a horse cannot perform its best on a bad day. Today, we introduce the Condition System, the key variable to unlocking 100% of your horse's potential! Condition is a value between 1% and 100% represent","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T08:16:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815559651","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402300-1827626365756326","game_id":"steam-4402300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Birth of a Legend: 'Breeding' and 'Taming'","summary":"Hello, aspiring Ranchers! We’re back with our second Dev Log!In the world of horse racing, intense training is vital, but the ultimate champion is often defined by two things: lineage and early upbringing. Today, we’re diving deep into the core systems for creating your future star: 'Breeding' and 'Taming.'1. The Foundation of Lineage: BreedingA true legend isn't born overnight. Excellence is inherited through generations of superior genes.Inheritance of Stats & Potentials: A parent’s stats set ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T02:46:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365756326","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402300-1826362059923228","game_id":"steam-4402300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Core Systems: 'Stats' and 'Potentials'","summary":"Hello, aspiring Ranchers!As we gallop toward the official release of , we are thrilled to introduce our very first Dev Log!To kick things off, we’ll be diving into the backbone of our game: the 'Stats' system that defines your horse’s physical prowess, and the 'Potentials' system—the ultimate X-factor that can turn the tide of any race.1. The Foundation: The 5-Core Stat SystemIn , every horse is born with 5 core attributes that directly influence their performance on the track:Speed: Determines ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T06:07:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059923228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4402300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4402300":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4402300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5074680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4402300","app_id":4402300,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"06d2b2ba6d218b966c23f354c0a94b1194b4c4a032284dfa1d9345916a51442c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Derby Life: Ranch & Race는 오픈 월드로 구현된 목장에서 나만의 경주마를 키우는 게임입니다. 자연 속에서 말과 교감하고 함께 탐험하며, 평범한 망아지를 최고의 경주마로 키워내세요. 충분히 성장했다면, 이제 세계가 무대입니다. 월드투어에 도전해 우승을 노려보세요. 다음 챔피언의 이름은, 바로 당신의 말입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Nexelon","creator_clan_account_id":45972586}],"developers":[{"name":"Nexelon","creator_clan_account_id":45972586}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Derby Trailer ","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792411337","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4402300/1393076322/6d179fdb1a9b15187493505a81500796ecfb3b86/1792403854/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4402300/1393076322/6d179fdb1a9b15187493505a81500796ecfb3b86/1792403854/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4402300/1393076322/6d179fdb1a9b15187493505a81500796ec